    "description": "When commanding your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a>, the type they gain is increased by one step (a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> allows a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> allows a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, and a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a> allows a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>). Additionally, your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> gain Hit Points equal to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> modifier times your Heroic Level.",
